---
description: Visual design rules
globs: src/**/*.tsx
---
- Clean and minimal: neutral grays, indigo brand color, 1px gray-200 borders, light shadows only on popovers/modals.
- Inter font, 8px spacing grid, 8px radius (12px for modals).
- Semantic colors only for status/priority/score (Hot red-orange, Warm amber, Cold blue).
- Must be responsive and keyboard accessible, with visible focus rings.